  "navBooking": "Booking Guide",
  "bookingEyebrow": "BEFORE WE MEET",
  "bookingIntro": "Please read these notes before booking. They cover how to book and how to get ready for our chat.",
  "bookingLine": "Book through our official LINE account",
  "bookingTitle1": "How to book",
  "bookingBody1": "<p>Ling posts all available times for the next month on Instagram <strong>@kuro_listen</strong> at <strong>8 p.m. on the 20th of each month</strong>.</p><p>Once bookings open, please book through the <strong>official LINE account</strong>. Send the times that work for you, with your first choice at the top.</p><p>After sending your request, please wait for a booking confirmation before sending more messages. Extra messages can change your place in the queue and affect your booking.</p>",
  "bookingTitle2": "Is my booking confirmed?",
  "bookingBody2": "<p>You’ll receive a <strong>booking confirmation (「成交通知」)</strong> with your date and time. Your booking is only confirmed once you receive this message.</p><p>If you haven’t received one, don’t worry. Any times still available will be posted on Instagram.</p>",
  "bookingTitle3": "Who can book",
  "bookingBody3": "<p>You must be the pet’s <strong>primary caregiver</strong>. Former partners and people who previously cared for the pet cannot book.</p><p>Please also be willing to share feedback <strong>within 7 days after the session</strong>, using either option:</p><ul><li>Share your experience or feedback in an Instagram Story and tag <strong>@kuro_listen</strong>.</li><li>Send feedback through LINE and allow Ling to share it on Instagram.</li></ul>",
  "bookingTitle4": "Which pets can join",
  "bookingBody4": "<ul><li>Your pet must be <strong>at least 10 months old</strong>.</li><li>Your pet must have lived with you for <strong>at least 3 months</strong>, so you’ve had time to get to know each other.</li></ul><p>You, your pet, and Ling may see things differently. Please come with an <strong>open mind and a willingness to talk things through</strong>.</p>",
  "bookingTitle5": "How the session works",
  "bookingBody5": "<p>A session lasts <strong>60 minutes</strong>. It’s a <strong>live text chat between you, your pet, and Ling</strong>, with Ling sharing your pet’s messages. You just need to be comfortable chatting with Ling by text.</p><p>Your pet can be asleep or away from you, as long as they’re <strong>not feeling physically unwell at the time</strong>.</p>",
  "bookingTitle6": "What to send beforehand",
  "bookingBody6": "<p>Please send your questions, photos, and what you call yourself when talking to your pet <strong>2 days before the session</strong>.</p><p>Please prepare <strong>4–5 bright, clear, high-resolution photos</strong> taken <strong>within the last 3 months</strong>. At least one should show your pet <strong>facing the camera and looking straight at it, with the upper half of their body or their whole body in view</strong>.</p><p>You can also send photos of any people, things, or places you’d like to talk about. These can help our chat go more smoothly.</p>",
  "bookingTitle7": "What we can talk about",
  "bookingBody7": "<p>We can talk about favorite foods, toys, places, and friends, as well as your pet’s thoughts and feelings.</p><p><strong>We don’t discuss medical treatments or take requests to force a pet to change their behavior.</strong> Please don’t use guilt or emotional pressure on your pet. Ling will skip questions like these.</p>",
  "bookingTitle8": "Help your pet prepare",
  "bookingBody8": "<p>For the <strong>3 days before the session</strong>, remind your pet at least once a day:</p><blockquote>“In a few days, a friendly lady will come to chat with you.”</blockquote><p>This helps your pet know what to expect, so Ling won’t feel like a stranger suddenly interrupting their day.</p>",
  "bookingTitle9": "Being on time and canceling",
  "bookingBody9": "<p>If you need to cancel, please tell Ling <strong>at least 60 minutes before your appointment</strong>. You can still book another session later.</p><p>Please be online at your booked time. Ling will wait <strong>10 extra minutes</strong>. If you still haven’t joined, <strong>you won’t be able to book future sessions</strong>.</p><p>If you arrive late, the time you’ve missed won’t be added back to your session.</p>",
  "bookingTitle10": "Ending the session and agreeing to these notes",
  "bookingBody10": "<p>If Ling or your pet feels uncomfortable, Ling may <strong>end the session right away</strong>. Your pet’s comfort in body, mind, and spirit comes first.</p><p><strong>By booking, you agree to all the notes and requirements above.</strong></p>"
